  "description": "The Service Route endurance bike is enhanced with our highest-grade Studio NEXT carbon fiber and a more sophisticated carbon lay-up to reduce frame weight by 140 grams, producing the ultimate combination of efficient aerodynamics, high comfort, and low weight.\nFrame weight: 880 grams (size M) - The Studio NEXT Service Route is one of the lightest endurance road bikes on the market\nStudio NEXT Carbon - Our highest grade carbon fiber and most sophisticated carbon lay-up reduces frame weight by 140 grams\nExclusive premium Studio NEXT paint color options\nPaint matched one-piece aero cockpits maximize aerodynamics and aesthetics\nAero Design - Wind tunnel-refined tube shapes developed in conjunction with the Service Course increase efficiency and speed\nEndurance Fork Design - A compliant fork with taller axle-to-crown height improves comfort while maintaining a sleek appearance with fewer spacers\nEndurance Geometry - Taller stack height and relaxed riding positions improve rider comfort and stability during long rides\nWide Tire Clearance - Clearance for tires up to 34mm+ wide\nUDH - Universal Derailleur Hanger for serviceability and compatibility\nThreaded T47A BB - Silently increases stiffness, serviceability, and reliability",
